Sprint 3 work follows the project skill `.claude/skills/sprint3-agentic-cicd/SKILL.md`
(invoke `/sprint3-agentic-cicd`). It is the single source of truth: phase plan
(`references/12-phase-plan.md`), component specs (`references/01`–`11`), scripts, templates,
catalogs, and guardrails.

Before editing: run `python3 .claude/skills/sprint3-agentic-cicd/scripts/preflight.py --brief`
and `python3 .claude/skills/sprint3-agentic-cicd/scripts/sprint3_progress.py`.

Use `/opt/anaconda3/envs/tcs_practice_env/bin/python` for pytest, ruff, and uvicorn. Finish a
phase with `bash .claude/skills/sprint3-agentic-cicd/scripts/run_sprint3_checks.sh` green and
one commit.

Hard rules: no production target or edge past UAT; only `orchestrator.yml` runs on push;
Jev routes with TypeSafe Choice/Noul only; secrets by placeholder name only; generated
commands pass `orchestrator/policy.py`; cloud runners plan unless `ORCHESTRATOR_CLOUD_APPLY=1`.
